<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" version="24.0.0"><diagram id="1. " name="1. Overview (plain language)"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1400" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="1. 1" value="How lsm-kv shares work between threads" style="text;html=1;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1000" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 2" value="Several things happen at the same time inside the store. This page shows who does what, which shared things they touch, and the rules that stop them from getting stuck. The next page is the technical version." style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="62" width="1300" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 3" value="Who does the work" style="text;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="120" width="400" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 4" value="Shared things (each has one key, only one holder at a time)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="120" width="460" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 5" value="&lt;b&gt;Your app&lt;/b&gt; (any number at once)&lt;br&gt;Saves data (put, delete) and looks it up (get)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="400" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 6" value="&lt;b&gt;Flush worker&lt;/b&gt; (one, always running)&lt;br&gt;When the in-memory table is full, writes it to disk as a sorted file" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="330" width="400" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 7" value="&lt;b&gt;Compaction worker&lt;/b&gt; (one, coming in week 4)&lt;br&gt;Tidies the disk files: merges small files into bigger sorted ones and throws away old versions" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="500" width="400" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 8" value="&lt;b&gt;1. The journal&lt;/b&gt; (write-ahead log)&lt;br&gt;Every save is written here first, so nothing is lost if the power goes out. One save at a time" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="160" width="460" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 9" value="&lt;b&gt;2. The catalog&lt;/b&gt; (manifest)&lt;br&gt;The official list of which files belong to the store. Updated when a file is added or removed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="330" width="460" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 10" value="&lt;b&gt;3. The shelf&lt;/b&gt; (in-memory state)&lt;br&gt;The data still in memory, and the list of files to read. Only quick memory work while holding this key" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="500" width="460" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 11" value="saves go here first" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1. 5" target="1. 8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 12" value="looks up data, adds saved data" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.85;entryX=0;entryY=0.15;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1. 5" target="1. 10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 13" value="only when starting a new journal page" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.6;entryX=0;entryY=0.2;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1. 5" target="1. 9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 14" value="adds the new file" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1. 6" target="1. 9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 15" value="makes the new file readable" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.8;entryX=0;entryY=0.45;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1. 6" target="1. 10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 16" value="swaps old files for merged ones" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.2;entryX=0;entryY=0.8;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1. 7" target="1. 9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 17" value="swaps the file list" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.6;entryX=0;entryY=0.75;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="1. 7" target="1. 10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 18" value="The workers never touch the journal: only your app does" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;align=center;fontColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="300" width="400" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 19" value="Why rules are needed: a freeze (deadlock)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="650" width="1300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 20" value="A freeze happens when two workers each hold a key the other one needs, and both wait for the other to let go. Neither ever does, so the store stops with no error and no crash. The rules below make that impossible." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="690" width="1320" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 21" value="The four rules that keep it from freezing" style="text;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="790" width="1300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 22" value="&lt;b&gt;Same order, always&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Keys are always picked up in the same order: journal, then catalog, then shelf. Never backwards" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="830" width="310" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 23" value="&lt;b&gt;Don't wait while holding&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nobody waits for a worker while holding the catalog or the shelf key" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="370" y="830" width="310" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 24" value="&lt;b&gt;Workers stay out of the journal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;So a save waiting on a worker can never block that worker" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="830" width="310" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 25" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading never waits on disk&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Looking data up only takes the shelf key, and only for quick memory work, never a disk write" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1030" y="830" width="330" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="1. 26" value="Legend: solid line = happens today. Dashed line = only sometimes, or planned (compaction, week 4). Dashed box = not built yet." style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="970" width="1320" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="2. " name="2. Threads and locks (technical)"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1400" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2. 1" value="Threads, locks, and waits in Store" style="text;html=1;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1200" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 2" value="Lock order is WAL -&gt; Manifest -&gt; State, top to bottom on the right. A thread may skip a lock, never take one above a lock it holds. Source: src/store.rs, rules in md/CONCURRENCY.md." style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="62" width="1300" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 3" value="Threads" style="text;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="115" width="430" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 4" value="Locks (in lock order)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="115" width="460" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 5" value="&lt;b&gt;Caller threads: put / delete&lt;/b&gt; (N)&lt;br&gt;1. lock WAL (held for the whole put)&lt;br&gt;2. if the memtable is full: State wait for a frozen slot, then Manifest save, then State swap&lt;br&gt;3. append + fsync, then State insert" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="155" width="430" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 6" value="&lt;b&gt;Caller threads: get&lt;/b&gt; (N)&lt;br&gt;State: look up active memtable, clone frozen + SSTable Arcs, unlock&lt;br&gt;then search frozen memtables + SSTables with no lock" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="300" width="430" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 7" value="&lt;b&gt;Flush thread&lt;/b&gt; (1)&lt;br&gt;1. State: take oldest frozen memtable not waiting on a retry&lt;br&gt;2. write + fsync + open SSTable, no lock&lt;br&gt;3. Manifest: add SSTable, drop segment, save&lt;br&gt;4. delete segment, no lock&lt;br&gt;5. State: install reader, notify_all" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="410" width="430" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 8" value="&lt;b&gt;Compaction thread&lt;/b&gt; (1, planned PR 4d)&lt;br&gt;1. State: pick inputs (L0 &gt;= 4 files or a level over target),&lt;br&gt;   never L0 files newer than the oldest waiting memtable&lt;br&gt;2. merge + write outputs, no lock&lt;br&gt;3. Manifest: add outputs, remove inputs, save&lt;br&gt;4. State: swap SSTable lists, notify_all&lt;br&gt;5. delete inputs, no lock (open Arcs keep them readable)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="555" width="430" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 9" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Mutex&amp;lt;WalState&amp;gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;WAL writer (active segment), segment number, next seq&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;held: a whole put, including the fsync&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;taken by: put / delete only&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="155" width="460" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 10" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Mutex&amp;lt;Manifest&amp;gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;live WAL segments, SSTables (+ level, planned), next file number, last seq&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;held: change a copy + save (tmp, fsync, rename, fsync dir)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;taken by: put at a swap, flush, compaction&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="300" width="460" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 11" value="&lt;b&gt;3. Mutex&amp;lt;State&amp;gt; + Condvar state_changed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;active memtable, frozen queue (VecDeque, oldest first), SSTables (newest max_seq first, by level planned), failed, closing, flush_error&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;held: memory-only steps, never file I/O&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;taken by: every thread&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="455" width="460" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 12" value="1. whole put" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.15;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2. 5" target="2. 9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 13" value="2. only at a swap" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2. 5" target="2. 10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 14" value="wait / swap / insert" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.85;entryX=0;entryY=0.1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2. 5" target="2. 11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 15" value="lookup + clone Arcs" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2. 6" target="2. 11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 16" value="step 3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=0;entryY=0.6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2. 7" target="2. 10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 17" value="steps 1, 5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.7;entryX=0;entryY=0.55;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2. 7" target="2. 11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 18" value="step 3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.2;entryX=0;entryY=0.9;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2. 8" target="2. 10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 19" value="steps 1, 4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.6;entryX=0;entryY=0.85;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="2. 8" target="2. 11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 20" value="flush + compaction threads never take the WAL lock (rule 2)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=3;align=center;fontColor=#b85450;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="420" width="390" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 21" value="Waits (all on state_changed, which releases State while asleep)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="715" width="640" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 22" value="&lt;b&gt;put&lt;/b&gt; waits for a free frozen slot (queue full) ... woken by the flush thread&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;flush thread&lt;/b&gt; waits for a frozen memtable, or a retry time ... woken by a swapping put&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;compaction thread&lt;/b&gt; waits for L0 &amp;gt;= 4 or a level over target ... woken by flush, and by itself&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;everyone&lt;/b&gt; is woken by failed / closing (rule 7)&lt;br&gt;Always in a loop: while !ready &amp;amp;&amp;amp; !failed &amp;amp;&amp;amp; !closing { wait } (rule 6)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="750" width="640" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 23" value="Rules (md/CONCURRENCY.md)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="715" width="660" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 24" value="1. Lock order WAL -&amp;gt; Manifest -&amp;gt; State, skipping is fine, never backwards&lt;br&gt;2. Flush thread never takes WAL&lt;br&gt;3. Never wait for the flush thread holding Manifest or State&lt;br&gt;4. No file I/O under State&lt;br&gt;5. Readers never take WAL or Manifest&lt;br&gt;6. Wait in a loop (spurious wakeups, another writer took the slot)&lt;br&gt;7. Every waiter has a way out: failed / closing -&amp;gt; notify_all&lt;br&gt;8. Hold WAL across append + memtable insert (same order in WAL and memtable)&lt;br&gt;9. Join threads with no lock held&lt;br&gt;10. Poisoned lock = store failed&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;11. (planned) Compaction thread never takes WAL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;12. (planned) Nobody waits for the compaction thread&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;13. (planned) L0 -&amp;gt; L1 never takes an L0 file newer than the oldest waiting memtable, and always takes every older overlapping L0 file&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="750" width="660" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 25" value="No lock held" style="text;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="905" width="640" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="2. 26" value="Writing an SSTable (tmp, fsync, rename, fsync dir)&lt;br&gt;Reading SSTables and frozen memtables (Arc keeps them alive)&lt;br&gt;Deleting a WAL segment or an old SSTable (an open Arc keeps an unlinked file readable)&lt;br&gt;Joining the flush / compaction thread in close" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="940" width="640" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>